#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ", and feel free to"
msgstr ", ແລະ ສາມາດ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"1. After placing your orders, look at our Kitchen Display. Click the "
"\"Backend\" menu in the right corner to return to your backend, then switch "
"to the Kitchen Display App."
msgstr ""
"1. ຫຼັງຈາກສັ່ງລາຍການແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃນເຮືອນຄົວ (Kitchen Display). ກົດເມນູ "
"\"Backend\" ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບໄປໜ້າຫຼັງບ້ານ, ແລ້ວສະຫຼັບໄປທີ່ແອັບ Kitchen Display."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"1. First, create all your employees in the database. Navigate to the "
"Employee App to do so."
msgstr ""
"1. ທຳອິດ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງລາຍຊື່ພະນັກງານທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ໄປທີ່ແອັບ ພະນັກງານ (Employee) ເພື່ອດ"
"ຳເນີນການ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "1. Point of sale"
msgstr "1. ຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ (POS)"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"1. You are ready to welcome your first customers. To do so, select a table "
"on the floor map and select the products they asked for from the list."
msgstr ""
"1. ທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວທີ່ຈະຕ້ອນຮັບລູກຄ້າກຸ່ມທຳອິດ. ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກໂຕະຢູ່ຜັງແຜນຜັງຮ້ານ ແລ້ວເລືອກລາຍການສິ"
"ນຄ້າທີ່ລູກຄ້າສັ່ງຈາກລາຍການ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. Create your employees' roles under the \"Settings\" tab. Some are already "
"created for this demo."
msgstr ""
"2. ສ້າງບົດບາດໜ້າທີ່ຂອງພະນັກງານພາຍໃຕ້ແຖບ \"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\". ບາງບົດບາດໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄວ້ແລ້ວສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນຕົວ"
"ຢ່າງນີ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "2. Kiosks and self-ordering"
msgstr "2. ຕູ້ຄີອອສກ໌ ແລະ ການສັ່ງອາຫານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. Open your preparation screen. Your orders are there. You can now mark "
"them as done either line by line or the entire order by clicking on the top."
msgstr ""
"2. ເປີດໜ້າຈໍການກຽມອາຫານ. ລາຍການສັ່ງຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໝາຍວ່າສຳເລັດແລ້ວແບບເທື່ອລ"
"ະລາຍການ ຫຼື ໝາຍສຳເລັດທັງໝົດໃນຄຳສັ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍກົດປຸ່ມດ້ານເທິງ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. To make it more interesting, feel free to create a second order. For this "
"one, select the \"Burger Menu Combo\" product. You can choose 2 burger "
"options burger options and 4 different drinks. This \"Combo\" feature will "
"allow you to create a menu with several courses and choices for each."
msgstr ""
"2. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໜ້າສົນໃຈຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ, ລອງສ້າງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ທີສອງ. ສຳລັບລາຍການນີ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກສິນຄ້າ \"Burger "
"Menu Combo\". ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເບີເກີໄດ້ 2 ຢ່າງ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງດື່ມຕ່າງກັນ 4 ຢ່າງ. ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"\"Combo\" ນີ້ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງເມນູທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຊຸດອາຫານ ແລະ ຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອັນໄດ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"3. If you select Max Frite as a customer for your order, you can see that "
"there is a Loyalty Program running on your Point of Sale. Every money spent "
"provide a loyalty point, and 200 loyalty points give access to a free Combo "
"Menu."
msgstr ""
"3. ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກ Max Frite ເປັນລູກຄ້າສຳລັບລາຍການສັ່ງຂອງທ່ານ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມີໂຄງການສະສົມຄະແນນ "
"(Loyalty Program) ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຈຸດຂາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ທຸກໆຍອດເງິນທີ່ໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄະແນນສະສົມ, ແລະ ເມື່ອ"
"ຮອດ 200 ຄະແນນ ຈະສາມາດແລກຮັບເມນູ Combo ຟຣີໄດ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"3. Odoo provides your an order status display to let your customer see when "
"their order is ready. It is automatically setup and available by clicking "
"the \"Order status screen\" button on the preparation display."
msgstr ""
"3. Odoo ມີໜ້າຈໍສະແດງສະຖານະການສັ່ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າເຫັນວ່າລາຍການອາຫານຂອງຕົນພ້ອມຮັບແລ້ວຫຼືຍັງ. ລະບົບໄ"
"ດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍກົດປຸ່ມ \"Order status screen\" ຢູ່ໜ້າຈໍການກ"
"ຽມອາຫານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "3. Preparation displays"
msgstr "3. ຈໍສະແດງຜົນການກຽມອາຫານ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"3. Return to the Planning App. You can see a few shifts ready to be planned. "
"Select the down arrow next to the publish button and click \"Auto Plan.\" "
"Your shifts will be automatically assigned based on your employees' "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"3. ກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ແອັບ ວາງແຜນ (Planning). ທ່ານຈະເຫັນກະການເຮັດວຽກຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງພ້ອມສຳລັບການວາງແຜນ. "
"ເລືອກລູກສອນລົງຂ້າງປຸ່ມເຜີຍແຜ່ ແລ້ວກົດ \"Auto Plan.\" ລະບົບຈະຈັດແບ່ງກະເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຕາມຄ"
"ວາມພ້ອມຂອງພະນັກງານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "4. Replenishment"
msgstr "4. ການເຕີມສິນຄ້າ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "4. You can still reassign any shift to adapt the planning."
msgstr ""
"4. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນການມອບໝາຍກະເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ໄດ້ ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນແຜນການໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"5. Once you are happy with it, send it to your co-workers by smashing the "
"publish button."
msgstr ""
"5. ເມື່ອພໍໃຈກັບແຜນແລ້ວ, ສົ່ງໃຫ້ເພື່ອນຮ່ວມງານຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ເລີຍ ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມເຜີຍແຜ່."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "5. Plan your services"
msgstr "5. ວາງແຜນການບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">⚠️</i>"
msgstr "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">⚠️</i>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🎉</i>"
msgstr "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🎉</i>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">💡</i>"
msgstr "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">💡</i>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🔁</i>"
msgstr "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🔁</i>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🚀</i>"
msgstr "<i class=\"o_editor_banner_icon mb-3 fst-normal\">🚀</i>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"display-4-fs\"><strong>Fast Food Restaurant</strong></span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"display-4-fs\"><strong>ຮ້ານອາຫານຟາດຟູດ</strong></span>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h1-fs\"><strong>Do you want to go further?</strong></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h1-fs\"><strong>ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄປໄກກວ່ານີ້ອີກບໍ?</strong></span>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>1. Flow 1:</strong> Most products need a human assessment as the "
"remaining quantity cannot be automatically computed. For those: Go to your "
"Purchase App to easily create Requests for Proposal or Purchase Orders."
msgstr ""
"<strong>1. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1:</strong> ສິນຄ້າສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຕ້ອງມີການກວດສອບຕົວຈິງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຈຳນວນທີ່ເຫຼືອບໍ່ສາ"
"ມາດຄຳນວນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້. ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ: ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແອັບ ການຈັດຊື້ (Purchase) ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບສະເໜີ"
"ລາຄາ ຫຼື ໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>2. Flow 2:</strong> For products that can be tracked, such as "
"bottled beers and sodas, you can use automated purchases. To try it, "
"navigate to your Point of Sale and sell a Blond Beer to a customer."
msgstr ""
"<strong>2. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 2:</strong> ສຳລັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ສາມາດຕິດຕາມສະຕັອກໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ເບຍຂວດ ແລະ ນ້ຳອັດ"
"ລົມ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ລະບົບການສັ່ງຊື້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອທົດລອງໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າຈຸດຂາຍ (Point of Sale) ແລ້"
"ວຂາຍ Blond Beer ໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong><span class=\"h1-fs\">Use case:</span></strong>"
msgstr "<strong><span class=\"h1-fs\">ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້:</span></strong>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Basics:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ພື້ນຖານ:</strong>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Kiosks</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕູ້ຄີອອສກ໌</strong>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Self-ordering</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ</strong>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At the end of your service, remember to close your register. To do so, in "
"the Point of Sale App, select \"Close Register\" in the top-right menu. You "
"can then precise your cash amount and validate the closing."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການບໍລິການ, ຢ່າລືມປິດກະເງິນຂອງທ່ານ. ໂດຍໄປທີ່ແອັບ Point of Sale, ເລືອກ \"Close "
"Register\" ຢູ່ເມນູມຸມຂວາເທິງ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດກວດລະບຸຈຳນວນເງິນສົດ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນການປິດໄດ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model:planning.role,name:fast_food.planning_role_2
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "ບາຣ໌"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:product.template,name:fast_food.product_product_54_product_template
msgid "Beef 1kg"
msgstr "ຊີ້ນງົວ 1 ກິໂລ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:uom.uom,name:fast_food.uom_uom_1
msgid "Bin"
msgstr "ຖັງ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:product.template,name:fast_food.product_product_59_product_template
msgid "Blond Beer"
msgstr "ເບຍ Blond Beer"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:product.template,name:fast_food.product_product_55_product_template
msgid "Butter"
msgstr "ມັນເບີ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "By doing so, you have only 23 beers left in your stock."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຮັດແນວນີ້, ເບຍໃນສະຕັອກຂອງທ່ານຈະເຫຼືອພຽງ 23 ຂວດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
