#: code:addons/fast_food/static/src/js/my_tour.js:0
msgid "Get on track and explore our recommendations for your Odoo usage here!"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຮຽນຮູ້ ແລະ ເບິ່ງຄຳແນະນຳໃນການນຳໃຊ້ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້!"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "ສະບາຍດີ!"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you navigate to your Purchase App, you can see a new Purchase Order that "
"is ready to be sent. You can choose a packaging if your product has an "
"existing one."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານໄປທີ່ແອັບ ການຈັດຊື້ (Purchase), ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໃໝ່ທີ່ພ້ອມສົ່ງອອກ. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຮູບແບບການ"
"ຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ໄດ້ ຖ້າສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານມີການກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to assign them an Odoo user account, you can select a related "
"user in the same \"Settings\" tab."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການກຳນົດບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ Odoo ໃຫ້ແກ່ພວກເຂົາ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ໃນແຖບ \"ການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ\" ອັນດຽວກັນ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to execute a practical guided tour of this module, you should "
"Import demo data and try the Demo - Use Case. (In the next Knowledge Article)"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຕົວຈິງຂອງໂມດູນນີ້, ຄວນນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ ແລ້ວທົດລອງໃຊ້ "
"Demo - Use Case. (ໃນບົດຄວາມ Knowledge ຕໍ່ໄປ)"

