#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Make them pay the orders to release the table and continue your service."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນເພື່ອເຄຼຍໂຕະ ແລະ ໃຫ້ບໍລິການລູກຄ້າຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage Loyalty Programs and many other kind of promotions, gifts and coupons "
"in the related page in your Point of Sales App &gt; Products."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການໂຄງການສະສົມຄະແນນ ລວມທັງໂປຣໂມຊັນອື່ນໆ, ຂອງຂວັນ ແລະ ຄູປອງ ໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນແອັບ "
"Point of Sale &gt; ສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage all your communication channels in one place with Odoo <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Marketing Automation</font></strong>, <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Email Marketing</font></strong>, <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Social Media Marketing</font></strong>, and "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">SMS Marketing</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການທຸກຊ່ອງທາງການສື່ສານຂອງທ່ານໃນບ່ອນດຽວຜ່ານ Odoo <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Marketing Automation</font></strong>, <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Email Marketing</font></strong>, <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Social Media Marketing</font></strong>, ແລະ <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">SMS Marketing</font></strong>."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage recurring tasks and never forget any replenishment or cleaning with "
"the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Project App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການວຽກປະຈຳ ແລະ ບໍ່ພາດທຸກການເຕີມສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ການອະນາໄມ ດ້ວຍ <strong><font class=\"text-"
"o-color-1\">ແອັບ ໂຄງການ (Project)</font></strong>."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your accounting easier than ever with a completely integrated "
"environment. (<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Accounting App</font></"
"strong>)"
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນກວ່າທີ່ເຄີຍ ດ້ວຍລະບົບທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນຢ່າງສົມບູນ. (<strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ ບັນຊີ (Accounting)</font></strong>)"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo also provides easy self ordering possibilities. Print a specific QR "
"code for each table on your Point of Sale settings and allow your customer "
"to order directly on their mobile phone."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ຍັງຮອງຮັບການສັ່ງອາຫານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ. ພຽງແຕ່ພິມ QR Code ສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຕະໃນການຕັ້"
"ງຄ່າ Point of Sale ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າສັ່ງອາຫານໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກໂທລະສັບມືຖືຂອງພວກເຂົາ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo is entirely integrated into an App. Download it to turn your phone into "
"an additional cashier (and much more)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ດາວໂຫຼດແອັບເພື່ອປ່ຽນໂທລະສັບຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງຄິດເງິນເ"
"ພີ່ມເຕີມ (ແລະ ອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ)."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as :"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍໃຫ້ແກ່ທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test "
"everything around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີໃນແພັກເກດນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ/ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົ"
"ວຢ່າງ, ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ!"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once the products are there, you can click the \"Receipt\" smart button to "
"validate your receipt and add these new products to your stock."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສິນຄ້າມາຮອດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກົດປຸ່ມ \"Receipt\" ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການຮັບສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນ"
"ສະຕັອກຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model:pos.payment.method,name:fast_food.pos_payment_method_2
msgid "Online Payment"
msgstr "ການຊຳລະເງິນອອນລາຍ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Organise your events and connect with your customers easily with the<strong> "
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Events App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການງານອີເວັ້ນຕ່າງໆ ແລະ ສື່ສານກັບລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍດ້ວຍ<strong> <font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ ອີເວັ້ນ (Events)</font></strong>."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "Plan your services easily using the Planning App."
msgstr "ວາງແຜນການບໍລິການຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ແອັບ Planning."

#. module: fast_food
#: model:product.category,name:fast_food.product_category_16
msgid "Purchase"
msgstr "ການຈັດຊື້"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Reordering rules are displayed in the smart buttons on top of your product. "
"You can see a minimum quantity, and a maximum. Each time the forecast stock "
"lowers beneath the minimum stock, it automatically creates a purchase order "
"to replenish to the maximum quantity."
msgstr ""
"ກົດລະບຽບການສັ່ງຊື້ຊ້ຳ ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນປຸ່ມ smart button ດ້ານເທິງຂອງສິນຄ້າ. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຈຳນວນຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລ"
"ະ ສູງສຸດ. ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ຍອດສະຕັອກຄາດການຫຼຸດລົງຕ່ຳກວ່າຍອດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອເຕີມ"
"ສິນຄ້າໃຫ້ຮອດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Replenishment is essential but challenging for a bar owner to systematize."
msgstr ""
"ການເຕີມສະຕັອກສິນຄ້າເປັນເລື່ອງສຳຄັນ ແຕ່ກໍເປັນສິ່ງທ້າທາຍສຳລັບເຈົ້າຂອງບາຣ໌ໃນການຈັດການໃຫ້ເປັນລະບົບ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model:product.template,name:fast_food.product_product_58_product_template
msgid "Sanitizer 250ml"
msgstr "ນ້ຳຢາຂ້າເຊື້ອ 250ml"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:planning.role,name:fast_food.planning_role_1
msgid "Service"
msgstr "ການບໍລິການ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:fast_food.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "Soft dependency"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Kitchen Displays</font></strong> "
"will ensure a great follow-up of every order in your bar and kitchen."
msgstr ""
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃນເຮືອນຄົວ (Kitchen Displays)</"
"font></strong> ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຕິດຕາມທຸກໆລາຍການສັ່ງໃນບາຣ໌ ແລະ ເຮືອນຄົວຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ແລ"
"ະ ຊັດເຈນ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The kiosk layout is optimized for vertical usage, as most booths use that "
"kind of display."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໜ້າຈໍຄີອອສກ໌ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະກັບການໃຊ້ງານໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຕູ້ບໍລິການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃຊ້ຈໍຮູບແບບ"
"ນີ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The stock is only updated when you close your register. Let's do it before "
"continuing to the next step."
msgstr ""
"ຍອດສະຕັອກຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອທ່ານປິດກະເງິນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ປິດກະກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr "ທັງໝົດນີ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຟຣີໃນແພັກເກດຂອງທ່ານ; ລອງເຂົ້າໄປສຳຫຼວດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເລີຍ! 🙃"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Inventory App</font></strong> "
"to manage your stock and receive products."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ ສາງສິນຄ້າ (Inventory)</font></"
"strong> ເພື່ອຈັດການສະຕັອກ ແລະ ຮັບສິນຄ້າເຂົ້າ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Planning App</font></strong> "
"to schedule and share your shifts with your employees."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ ວາງແຜນ (Planning)</font></"
"strong> ເພື່ອຈັດຕາຕະລາງ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນກະເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Point of Sale</font></strong> "
"at the desk for your sales. You can also download the Odoo Mobile App on any "
"phone to take orders. And create <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Kiosks </font><font class=\"text-o-color-5\"><span style=\"font-"
"weight: normal;\">or QR Codes</span></font></strong> to ensure self-ordering."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Point of Sale</font></strong> ຢູ່ເຄົາເ"
"ຕີສຳລັບການຂາຍ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດ Odoo Mobile App ລົງໃນໂທລະສັບເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮັບອໍເດີໄດ້ ແລະ ສ້າງ "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ຕູ້ຄີອອສກ໌ </font><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-5\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">ຫຼື QR Codes</span></font></"
"strong> ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການສັ່ງອາຫານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchase App</font></strong> "
"to reorder your products."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ ການຈັດຊື້ (Purchase)</font></"
"strong> ເພື່ອສັ່ງຊື້ສິນຄ້າເພີ່ມ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:web_tour.tour,rainbow_man_message:fast_food.knowledge_tour
msgid "Welcome! Happy exploring."
msgstr "ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ! ຂໍໃຫ້ເພີດເພີນກັບການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມຕື່ມບໍ?"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ Odoo ໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າແຜງຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can easily edit the floor map by clicking \"Edit plan\" in the top-right "
"menu when on the table selection step of your Point of Sale."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຜັງໂຕະໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ໂດຍກົດປຸ່ມ \"Edit plan\" ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເລືອກໂຕະຂອງ "
"Point of Sale."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can now email your Request for Proposal to your vendor or confirm it "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງອີເມວໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໄປຫາຜູ້ສະໜອງຂອງທ່ານ ຫຼື ກົດຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can see that there is a reordering rule configured for this product if "
"you go to Inventory &gt; Products &gt; Blond Beer"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມີການກຳນົດກົດການສັ່ງຊື້ຊ້ຳສຳລັບສິນຄ້ານີ້ ຖ້າທ່ານເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ສາງສິນຄ້າ &gt; ສິນຄ້າ &gt; "
"Blond Beer"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ສຳເລັດການທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວ! ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍຮູບແບບທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ Odoo ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບທຸລະກິ"
"ດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You currently have two steps in your Kitchen Displays: one for the kitchen/"
"bar and one for the service. You can configure steps in the kitchen display "
"configuration menu."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ ທ່ານມີ 2 ຂັ້ນຕອນໃນໜ້າຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃນເຮືອນຄົວ: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ ເຮືອນຄົວ/ບາຣ໌ ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ ພາ"
"ກສ່ວນບໍລິການ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໃນເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍເຮືອນຄົວ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade your Fast Food Restaurant package and check the related box."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່. ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; Industries &gt; "
"ອັບເກຣດແພັກເກດ ຮ້ານອາຫານຟາດຟູດ ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You have two main possibilities in Odoo to ease your replenishment process."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ມີ 2 ທາງເລືອກຫຼັກ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະບວນການເຕີມສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານສະດວກຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for Fast Food Restaurant package. By doing so, "
"we have installed many necessary apps to run your restaurant efficiently."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Odoo ສຳລັບຮ້ານອາຫານຟາດຟູດ. ລະບົບໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບທີ່ຈຳເປັນຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮ້ານອາ"
"ຫານຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນງານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various actions you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່"
"ອງໄວໃນແພັກເກດນີ້."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Your demo database comes with a kiosk to allow your customer to take orders "
"on your booths. Go to the Point of Sale App and select your kiosk to see how "
"it looks and try it!"
msgstr ""
"ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງທ່ານມາພ້ອມກັບລະບົບຕູ້ຄີອອສກ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າສັ່ງອາຫານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຢູ່ບູດ. ໄປທີ່ແອັບ Point "
"of Sale ແລ້ວເລືອກຕູ້ຄີອອສກ໌ຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອທົດລອງເບິ່ງຮູບແບບ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານ!"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Your orders will automatically move from a step to another while you move it "
"on your preparation display."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການສັ່ງຂອງທ່ານຈະຍ້າຍຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໄປອີກຂັ້ນຕອນໜຶ່ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍສະຖານະໃນໜ້າຈໍການກຽ"
"ມອາຫານ."

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "academy"
msgstr "ສະຖາບັນການຮຽນຮູ້ (academy)"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "and"
msgstr "ແລະ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "documentation"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືການໃຊ້ງານ"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "if you need help! <br/>"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ! <br/>"

#. module: fast_food
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fast_food.welcome_article_body
msgid "request a demo"
msgstr "ຮ້ອງຂໍການສາທິດການໃຊ້ງານ"
